00002| 00001| /**
00003| 00002|  * Typed API client for the nexus-server HTTP surface (CONTRACT.md §4).
00004| 00003|  * Same-origin only; every fetch is cache: no-store; `{"error": ...}` bodies
00005| 00004|  * become ApiError for the UI to toast.
00006| 00005|  */
00007| 00006| import type {
00008| 00007|   Case, CaseGraph, Entity, EntityDetail, Evidence, Health, LayaRanked,
00009| 00008|   PivotSuggestion, Relation, Task, TimelineEvent, NexusSettings,
